// About
section#about.section.section-xl.bg-default
	.container
		.row
			.col.text-center( data-animate!={class: 'fadeInUp'} )
				h3.h6 about
				h2 Our Church
		.row.row-30
			.col-lg-6(data-animate!={class: 'fadeInLeft'} )
				p.lead At Lintense Church, we want the love that Christ showed on the cross to flow out of our lives, impacting the community. We come from all different backgrounds and cultures but are united in the pursuit and worship of Christ. Above all else, we want to glorify God. We strongly believe that God does His work through the local church and that it is a vital part of the Christian life. Feel free to join us as we come together and let the Gospel transform us!
			.col-lg-6( data-animate!={class: 'fadeInRight'} )
				+img('index-02-700x400')


